# --- Python ---
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# --- Virtual environments ---
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/

# --- Editors / OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# --- Local, machine-specific config (mirrors fdo-squirrel's own pattern) ---
config.local.json

# --- Note ---
# data/ and dist/ are part of the reproducible pipeline output and are NOT
# ignored -- dist/ holds this repository's versioned, citable products
# (see primer-repo skill). data/raw/ can hold large local scans or Sketchfab
# downloads though; keep an eye on repo size before committing those.

# --- build_fdo's (S7) release output ---
# fdo-metadata.ttl, the HTML modelling report, the Mermaid source and
# fdo-squirrel's own re-zipped "finished FDO bundle": rebuilt by every
# `build_fdo` run from dist/<slug>.zip, which is already committed -- not a
# second citable fassung, same reasoning as fdo-squirrel-registry's own
# dist/release/ (PRIMER.md S8 pattern).
dist/*_release/
data/*
PATCH-README.md
cache*